GradientConsistency ==
    □(∀w ∈ Workers : worker_state[w] = "sending" ⇒ 
      gradients[w] = ComputeLocalGradient(batch_data[w], global_model))

ModelConvergence ==
    ♢(convergence_flag = TRUE ∨ epoch_counter = MaxEpochs)

\* Liveness properties
AllWorkersEventuallyCompute ==
